eveloperTagline":"AI Plan, split bills, Chat","ageRating":"13+","productDescription":"LetzGo.Live\n\nThe plan. The conversation. The split.\nTogether at last.\n\nLetzGo.Live brings messaging, events, and shared expenses into one place — built for groups that plan, register, chat, and settle up together.\n\nCOMPLIANCE AND TRUST\n• Server-driven minimum app version and optional force-update when your build is too old\n• In-app compliance notices when the API requires acknowledgement\n• Age verification at registration — country-aware birth date and minimum age from server policy\n• Profile completion aligned with what the backend expects before you join events and chats\n\nADVANCED TICKETING\nSell multiple ticket types on one event — not just one price and one capacity.\n\nSupported ticket types:\n• Standard — general admission\n• Early Bird — discounted tier with a sales end date\n• VIP (Premium) — higher price with perks\n• Group — team bookings with min/max group size\n• Recurring Slots — weekly, fortnightly, or monthly sessions; capacity per slot; guests pick their date\n• Multi-Day Pass — one pass across several event days\n\nAlso on tiers: age-band pricing, dynamic pricing as tiers fill, perks, tier waitlists (with auto-promote), AI Ticket Designer, and venue seating where layouts apply. Simple mode remains for one price and one capacity.\n\nIMPROVED CHAT AND PERFORMANCE\n• Faster, smoother chat list with loading skeletons and more stable composer layout\n• More reliable message sync and SQLite performance on long threads\n• Clearer message status and media handling\n• Verified name display where profiles are verified\n\nENHANCED EXPENSES\n• Sharper activity lists and balances after sync\n• Better offline and local overlay so list totals stay accurate while expenses catch up\n• Clearer multi-currency grouping and settlement coverage on activity details\n• Smoother create and edit expense flows\n\nEVENTS, MAPS, AND MORE\nAI trip and workshop planning, live locati