ring our services to 2 million farmers by 2023.\n\nWe provide expertized knowledge from quality crop production so that farmers can make Farm Decisions predict what will happen in the future and act more effectively as predicted.\n\nFeatures: Crop Advice: Get real-time crop advisories based on your location, weather conditions, and crop type. Stay informed about the latest farming techniques, pest control measures, and best practices to maximize your yield.\nWeather Update: Plan your farming activities effectively with accurate and timely weather forecasts. Get daily, weekly, and monthly weather forecasts to make informed decisions for planting, harvesting, and more.\nMarket Prices: Stay updated on market prices of different crops in different markets. Make informed decisions about when and where to sell your produce to get the best returns.\nExpert Consult: Connect with agricultural experts and extension services for personalized advice. Ask questions, seek guidance on specific issues, and get expert advice to overcome challenges in your farming journey.\nDiagnosis: Identify and resolve crop diseases quickly with our disease diagnosis feature. Upload photos of affected crops, and our app will provide information about the disease and suggest appropriate treatment methods.\nGovernment Schemes: Get information about various government schemes and subsidies available to farmers. Stay updated with the latest policies and programs aimed at supporting the farming community.\nCommunity Forum: Connect with a community of like-minded farmers. Share your experiences, learn from others, and create a network that fosters collaboration and knowledge exchange.\n\nPersonalized Dashboard: Customize your dashboard with information specific to your farm. Keep track of your crop cycle, expenses, and income to manage your farm efficiently.\nWhy choose the Kisaan Helpline?\nUser-friendly Interface: The app is designed with simplicity in mind, ensuring easy navigation for users of all l